        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "3.Let the petitioners appear before the concerned Court and get the warrant recalled."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7577aa7689f944eda481e036f48cd3af_26",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "7.In the considered view of this Court, it is not necessary for the learned Judicial Magistrate to straightaway act upon on the accused persons pleading guilty before the Court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5a17e83ca0d6444fa548267585067d6f_27",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The learned Magistrate must see if the accused persons understand the consequence and they have sufficient legal advice before they pleaded guilty."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b1f9f3fd87454be68319ea1728e19ddc_28",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Where the punishment provided is a quite serious, normally the Magistrates will not act upon the accused persons pleading guilty and will afford an opportunity to contest the case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1384ccce12604445b18be810603264c0_29",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Law on this issue is too well settled."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f1137cefb5c14f62b8636599ed55e2c5_31",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "8.The petitioners did not appear before the Court below and therefore Non Bailable Warrant has issued against the petitioners."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "beb0878f53034983917242d6fdb13361_32",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
