        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n9.Taking into consideration the facts and circumstances of the case and considering the fact that the petitioners on legal advice want to contest this case, the petitioners must be given an opportunity to contest the case on merits."
